From: Q1000K development
Subject: [PATCH] pinctrl: an7581: reserve board TX disable separately from PON

The Q1000K NAND DT and led.conf route TX_DISABLE to GPIO38. Allow
that GPIO consumer to coexist with the other five PON pins. Only the
activation bench opts in; preserve the existing whole-PON group.

--- a/drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-an7581.c
+++ b/drivers/pinctrl/airoha/pinctrl-an7581.c
@@ -378,6 +378,8 @@
 };
 
